    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Battle of Bites!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the colorful chaos of <strong>Hungry</strong>, the action-packed multiplayer game where you're not just playing to win, you're playing to feast! Take control of a Boomble, a lively ball of energy with one mission: <strong>eat your way to victory</strong>. Gobble up orbs scattered across the map to grow in size and power. But be careful, if any of the other Boombles is bigger than you, they\u2019ll swallow you whole!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381030/extras/23591f60d2b3dfaaef942aa7adfd1baa.avif?t=1754674150\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>In this high-stakes game of survival, strategy and speed are key. Outsmart opponents by navigating the map, collecting power-ups, and timing your attacks. Use clever maneuvers to dodge the giants and ambush smaller players to claim their points. The clock is ticking, and only the biggest, boldest Boomble will reign supreme when the timer hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dominate matches, you'll unlock exciting customization options, like flashy colors, quirky hats, and stylish accessories to give your Boomble personality. Whether you prefer a wizard look or a hilarious cowboy vibe, your Boomble will stand out as you conquer the leaderboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381030/extras/ab5f04cc897a6f2ad6c0157aecb45608.avif?t=1754674150\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Hungry</strong> isn\u2019t just a game, it\u2019s a fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled competition where every bite counts. Will you rise to the top or get devoured trying? There\u2019s only one way to find out: grab your Boomble, and let the feast begin!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Battle of Bites!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the colorful chaos of <strong>Hungry</strong>, the action-packed multiplayer game where you're not just playing to win, you're playing to feast! Take control of a Boomble, a lively ball of energy with one mission: <strong>eat your way to victory</strong>. Gobble up orbs scattered across the map to grow in size and power. But be careful, if any of the other Boombles is bigger than you, they\u2019ll swallow you whole!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381030/extras/23591f60d2b3dfaaef942aa7adfd1baa.avif?t=1754674150\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>In this high-stakes game of survival, strategy and speed are key. Outsmart opponents by navigating the map, collecting power-ups, and timing your attacks. Use clever maneuvers to dodge the giants and ambush smaller players to claim their points. The clock is ticking, and only the biggest, boldest Boomble will reign supreme when the timer hits zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dominate matches, you'll unlock exciting customization options, like flashy colors, quirky hats, and stylish accessories to give your Boomble personality. Whether you prefer a wizard look or a hilarious cowboy vibe, your Boomble will stand out as you conquer the leaderboard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381030/extras/ab5f04cc897a6f2ad6c0157aecb45608.avif?t=1754674150\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Hungry</strong> isn\u2019t just a game, it\u2019s a fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled competition where every bite counts. Will you rise to the top or get devoured trying? There\u2019s only one way to find out: grab your Boomble, and let the feast begin!</p>",
